                        


Item #:  SCP-5168

Object Class:  Euclid

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5168-2 is to be contained in a empty reinforced soundproof humanoid containment cell with only a table, two chairs and a small TV. Since SCP-5168-2 is very cooperative, it is allowed two movie selections every week. No personnel should touch SCP-5168-2. 2 fully armed security guards are to be stationed outside the entrance. 4 security cameras in each corner of the room are to be used to monitor SCP-5168-2. When meeting with SCP-5168-2, at least 1 armed security guard is to be there throughout the meeting. Although SCP-5168-2 is extremely cooperative, it is constantly armed and very dangerous. SCP-5168 cannot be disarmed. Access to SCP-5168-2 is to be approved by Dr. Volga. Through extensive testing after Operation [REDACTED], in the event of SCP-5168-2 breaking containment, the use of a Hermes class rail gun on a mobile platform is prohibited.

Description:  SCP-5168-2 appears to be the human male Private Mas Philip moulded with a carbon fibre-like material. Now labelled SCP-5168-1. SCP-5168-2 is 187m tall just as Private Maz was. Private Mas Philip was a former member of MTF Nu-7 ”Hammer Down” infantry force. He was considered KIA in Operation [REDACTED] to contain what is theorised to be the first instance of SCP-5168-1. SCP-5168-1 was seen attaching itself to Private Mas and then completely covered him. SCP-5168-2 only remembers that it’s name is Mas Philip and that it is a part of MTF Nu-7 ”Hammer Down”.

The anatomy of SCP-5168-2 is still not fully understood. SCP-5168-1 is an extremely strong material that is almost indescribable, nearly all ballistic weapons have no effect on 5082-2's body. SCP-5168-2 has 3 out of 5 main human senses; sight, hearing and touch. SCP-5168-2 can write and speak English the same way as Private Maz. SCP-5168-2 does not need food, water or air to survive. SCP-5168-2 still refers to itself as a soldier of the SCP Foundation and salutes every Foundation member [Except D-class personnel if found] it sees.

Addendum 5082-01:  In addition it seems that SCP-5168-2 is still fully armed in MTF Nu-7 gear. It is imprinted on its body although every piece of gear works, but in SCP-5168-1 form. SCP-5168-2 has been observed to not have the need to carry more than 2 magazines per gun. It seems the material that SCP-5168-2 is made out of has taken over Private Mas and testing to remove SCP-5168-1 from SCP-5168-2 has resorted in failure. It has been theorised by Dr. Volga that since SCP-5168-2 has no memory besides the training to kill, SCP-5168-2 may have wiped “unimportant” parts of Mas’s memories. It has exceptional aim and shooting speed compared to Mas Philip.

Addendum 5082-02 Test 2: 

Part A:  SCP-5168-2 was given a .44 Remington Magnum (This gun is not standard issue). When SCP-5168-2 picked up the gun it was immediately transformed and moulded using SCP-5168-1 leaving no trace of the gun. SCP-5168-2 was then instructed to shoot clay targets. The .44 Magnum worked perfectly with no stoppages. It was then given to the Foundation for further testing.

Part B:  SCP-5168-2 was then given a pencil, a stapler and a toaster. When SCP-5168-2 interacted with the items nothing was observed to change in the items.

Part C:  SCP-5168-2 was given a switchblade. When SCP-5168-2 picked up the switchblade it was immediately transformed and moulded using SCP-5168-1 leaving no trace of the switchblade. SCP-5168-2 was then instructed to slice pigs skin. The switchblade cut perfectly.

Part D:  For part D and E SCP-5168-2s left arm was amputated (Note: SCP-5168-2 cooperated with no problems). SCP-5168-2s left arm has no properties and did not affect all objects it touched. The current theory is that for objects to be transformed they must be connected to the main source.

Part E:  SCP-5168-2s arm was terminated after Part A and then SCP-5168-2 was given an amputated D-class left arm. When SCP-5168-2 touched the left arm it was immediately transformed and absorbed it. Soon SCP-5168-2s left arm started to grow back. SCP-5168-2 now has a left arm.

Addendum 5082-03:  Interview Log



Interviewed:  SCP-5168-2

Interviewer:  Dr. Volga

Foreword:  Interview conducted to find out what SCP-5168-2 remembers.

 

SCP-5168-2 salutes Dr. Volga and then sits down

Dr. Volga:  Good morning SCP-5168-2. My name is Dr. Volga and I am going to ask you a few questions. Now, what do you remember about your past?

SCP-5168-2:  Nothing much sir only a few things like I was and still am a soldier of this foundation serving in MTF Nu-7, the infantry force.

Dr. Volga:  Can you recall operation [REDACTED]?, what happened?

SCP-5168-2:  Well sir, In operation [REDACTED] squads were sent into ████████ forest to recover an anomaly and it was just me and squad, SCP-5168-2 pauses their faces fade from me. And then we found something, it was like a puddle[SCP-5168-1] of something weird. I knelled down and touched it, and suddenly I blacked out. I only heard gunshots and when I awoke my squad was dead around me. And I wound up here.

Dr. Volga:  Do you think of your squad?

SCP-5168-2:  Yes, everyday In my mind, I can't picture their faces but I can't forget the dead bodies around me in that forest.

SCP-5168-2 closes its eyes and then groans in pain

Dr. Volga:  We have heard you scream and fire your gun into the wall.

SCP-5168-2:  Yes sir I have

Dr. Volga:  Why?

SCP-5168-2:  Because I get angry at what I have become.

SCP-5168-2 looks at its hands and closes its fist

Dr. Volga:  So you know that you have become.

SCP-5168-2:  Yes sir, I don't fully know who I am and all I remember is my training and all the killing.

Dr. Volga:  SCP-5168-2 what do you think of the Foundation?

SCP-5168-2:  Sir, I believe the Foundation is necessary in the world we live in and in the end I am proud of my service. We Secure, Contain and Protect.

Dr. Volga:  SCP-5168-2, I think you can still serve the Foundation. As long as you keep cooperating with us you will be helping and serving the Foundation.

SCP-5168-2:  Sir yes sir

Dr. Volga:  That will do for today SCP-5168-2.

SCP-5168-2 salutes Dr. Volga as he leaves

 
