Addendum 5082-04 Test 3:  In Test 3, a D-Class personnel was sent into SCP-5168-2's containment cell. SCP-5168-2 was then instructed to touch the D-Class. When the D-Class was touched SCP-5168-1 started to expand onto the D-Class immediately and over the course of 12 seconds totally engulf the D-class with SCP-5168-1. SCP-5082-3 then started to scream for 30 seconds until falling silent. SCP-5082-3 then began to panic and shouting . SCP-5082-3 was then escorted out of the containment cell and then was terminated with a Hermes class rail gun. This concluded Test 3.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
